    hook:{title:"The ringtone that's 300 years old", body:"Vivaldi's <em>The Four Seasons</em>, Bach's music and Mozart's melodies turn up in adverts, ringtones and films all the time. Music written hundreds of years ago is still all around us. Knowing the periods helps you recognise styles — and perform them correctly."},
