    callout:{title:"Improvise", body:"Try improvising over a 12-bar blues using the blues scale: C, E♭, F, G♭, G, B♭, C."},
    activity:"Play or sing over a 12-bar blues in C (C–F–G) using the C blues scale. Record a short improvised solo.",
